<section class="container narrow section-top"><?php ff_heading($page,'University demonstration policy — not the gym’s official legal policy.'); ?><article class="prose policy-text"><?php if($page==='privacy'): ?><h2><?=e(t('What this project stores'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('The project stores account names, email addresses, password hashes, demonstration orders, memberships, passes, bookings, favorites, inquiries and newsletter choices. It does not request medical information or real payment credentials.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Why information is used'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Information supports sign-in, member tools, administrator review and demonstration workflows. Inquiries and subscriptions are stored in the project database. No outbound email delivery is configured.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Access and security'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Members can view their own records; authorized project administrators can manage application records. Passwords are hashed. Security sessions and anti-forgery tokens protect account actions.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Retention and requests'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Data remains until the project operator removes it or resets the demonstration environment. A formal business retention schedule has not been provided. Use the project inquiry form for access, correction or deletion requests; do not enter sensitive personal information.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('External links'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Instagram, research sources and map directions open external websites with their own privacy practices. No external map or tracking embed is loaded.'))?></p><?php elseif($page==='cookies'): ?><h2><?=e(t('necessary'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Necessary cookies support secure sessions and remember your consent decision. They are required for authentication and protected forms.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('preferences'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Optional preference storage remembers your language across visits only when you allow it. You can still select a language for the current page and session when optional preferences are rejected.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('analytics'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('No analytics or advertising service is installed. No optional tracking cookies are used. External directions are ordinary outbound links.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Your choice'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Accept all enables available preference storage. Reject optional keeps only necessary storage. Manage preferences lets you change your choice; the footer always provides access to settings.'))?></p><button type="button" class="button" data-cookie-open><?=e(t('manage_preferences'))?></button><?php else: ?><h2><?=e(t('University demonstration'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('This application is a Business Practice 2025/2026 student project about Fitness Factory in Ohrid. It is not represented as the business’s authorized official website.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Simulated payments and passes'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('All payments are simulated using predefined outcomes. No money is collected. Digital passes and membership records are marked DEMO and grant no real gym access. Pending demo payments require administrator confirmation.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Fictional bookings'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Trainers and class schedules are fictional. An active demo membership or pass allows booking eligible sessions with remaining capacity. One active booking per member and session is allowed. Confirmed bookings may be cancelled before the demo cutoff, normally 60 minutes before the start.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Business information'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Published package prices and opening hours come from supplied screenshots and remain subject to current confirmation. Class inclusion, wellness access, holiday hours, renewal and refund terms have not been verified. No demonstration rule should be treated as an actual gym policy.'))?></p><h2><?=e(t('Responsible use'))?></h2><p><?=e(t('Use fictional details for testing. Do not submit payment credentials, health information or other sensitive data. Do not use the project to interfere with other members or attempt unauthorized access.'))?></p><?php endif ?><p><a class="text-link" href="<?=e(url('contact'))?>"><?=e(t('contact'))?> <?=ff_icon()?></a></p></article></section>
